go-zod is a Go port of Zod, a TypeScript schema validation library by Colin
McDonnell (https://github.com/colinhacks/zod). Portions of this project are
derived from Zod, including string-format patterns, locale message text, the
issue taxonomy, and behavioural test cases ported from Zod's test suite. Zod is
distributed under the MIT License, reproduced in full below.

go-zod is an independent project. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
sponsored by Zod or Colin McDonnell. "Zod" is used only to describe what this
library is compatible with.

